{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35185","headline":"嘲段成式 · 周繇","name":"嘲段成式","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蹙鞠且徒爲，宁如目送时。\n报讐慙选耎，存想恨逶迟。\n促坐疑辟咡，衔盃强朵颐。\n恣情窥窈窕，曾恃好风姿。\n色授应难夺，神交愿莫辞。\n请君看曲谱，不负少年期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周繇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}